# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows/Linux 混合换行造成整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则可能无法执行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 文本文件明确类型
*.py   text diff=python
*.md   text
*.json text
*.txt  text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text

# 二进制文件
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary

# GitHub 语言统计：示例数据不计入项目语言
samples/sample.json linguist-documentation
samples/*.txt       linguist-documentation
